      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.049 (vs ₹0.061 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.049 (down from ₹0.061 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹16.1m (down 42% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.52m (down 21% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 9.5% (up from 6.9% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 32% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 23% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
